{"id":"wb-7-1153","name":"巨野文庙大成殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"巨野文庙","text":"巨野文庙，位于山东省菏泽市巨野县城区。现有的建筑建于明朝，在清朝时被辟为麟州书院，1947年以后文庙被废，大部分建筑损毁，仅存大成门、大成殿、西庑、东庑等建筑。\n2006年12月7日，授予山东省文物保护单位。2013年5月，巨野文庙大成殿被授予全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8E%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86786796,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86786796","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1babb5c533d1e14315213425.jpg","title":"Juye_Wenmiao_Dacheng_Dian,_Juye.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Juye_Wenmiao_Dacheng_Dian,_Juye.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/Juye_Wenmiao_Dacheng_Dian%2C_Juye.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"S.Z.","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​属于第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","width":320,"height":240}}